# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEXT COHORT DATE  ←  THE ONLY THING TO ADD
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# YYYY-MM-DD in East Africa Time (UTC+03:00). Set this to confirm the next
# cohort start date. The admin adds exactly this one value and everything
# else follows automatically:
#
#   - enrollment deadline  = cohort start - 3 days
#   - seats left           = 0..24, seeded by the cohort week
#   - countdown            = "2d 15h left" / "15h 30m left" / "45m left"
#
# When the enrollment deadline passes the schedule rolls forward to the next
# cohort on its own, so the site never shows a dead "Enrolment closed" state
# — it always points at the next thing to add.
#
# Leave it unset until the cohort date is confirmed; the site then advertises
# the next Monday as a rolling cohort.
VITE_NEXT_COHORT_START_DATE=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Booking submission endpoint
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Booking and newsletter forms send directly to the CS Academy support email
# through FormSubmit. No API credentials are required.
